   {1: t("Courts review orders only when a case is brought.", "Los tribunales revisan las órdenes solo cuando se presenta un caso."), 2: t("They do not expire on their own.", "No caducan solas."), 3: t("The story says the new President cancelled it.", "El relato dice que la revocó el nuevo presidente.")},
